{"unit_id":"ZhiHui6__dsh-sound-notify#card-zh","repo":"ZhiHui6/dsh-sound-notify","commit":"de3b314b468c852652cf2a58c6902fa7ddc50316","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-sound-notify 是适用于 DSH Web 客户端的声音通知插件，在设置页加入声音提示控制，并监听会话状态变化。它会为任务完成、任务失败和独立错误提示播放不同音效；内置九种由 Web Audio API 合成的音色，也允许添加本地音频作为自定义声音。用户可以分别选择事件音效、调节音量、关闭通知、预览或测试声音，并决定是否包含子代理会话。它适合希望不盯着会话页面也能听到任务状态变化的 DSH 用户。无需 API 密钥或外部服务；自定义音频与偏好保存在当前浏览器中。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:804-889","client.js:552-619","client.js:994-1009","client.js:182-196"]}
{"unit_id":"ZhiHui6__dsh-sound-notify#card-en","repo":"ZhiHui6/dsh-sound-notify","commit":"de3b314b468c852652cf2a58c6902fa7ddc50316","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-sound-notify plays browser alerts for completed, failed, or errored DSH sessions. It watches session changes and offers synthesized tones, custom audio, volume and event controls, previews, and sub-agent options. No API key or external service is needed; settings stay in browser storage.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:804-889","client.js:552-619","client.js:994-1009","client.js:182-196"]}
