{"unit_id":"ZhiHui6__dsh-sound-notify#feature-1","repo":"ZhiHui6/dsh-sound-notify","commit":"de3b314b468c852652cf2a58c6902fa7ddc50316","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-sound-notify 的功能「任务状态提示」：监听会话从运行到停止，并检查代理错误；完成、失败或独立错误提示会触发对应音效，短时间内的连续变化会合并处理。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:828-887"]}
{"unit_id":"ZhiHui6__dsh-sound-notify#feature-2","repo":"ZhiHui6/dsh-sound-notify","commit":"de3b314b468c852652cf2a58c6902fa7ddc50316","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-sound-notify 的功能「内置与自定义音效」：用户可在设置页选择九种合成音色，也可添加不超过 1.5 MB 的本地音频文件，并试听或删除自定义声音。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:14-15","client.js:569-629","client.js:641-654"]}
{"unit_id":"ZhiHui6__dsh-sound-notify#feature-3","repo":"ZhiHui6/dsh-sound-notify","commit":"de3b314b468c852652cf2a58c6902fa7ddc50316","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-sound-notify 的功能「通知偏好设置」：在 Settings 的声音提示分节中可开关通知、调节音量、为完成失败和错误分别选音，并设置是否包含子代理会话。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:552-569","client.js:674-799","client.js:994-1009"]}
{"unit_id":"ZhiHui6__dsh-sound-notify#feature-4","repo":"ZhiHui6/dsh-sound-notify","commit":"de3b314b468c852652cf2a58c6902fa7ddc50316","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-sound-notify 的功能「浏览器内声音播放」：内置音效由 Web Audio API 合成，自定义文件通过浏览器 Audio 播放；页面首次交互时尝试解锁音频播放。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:217-240","client.js:283-310","client.js:980-991"]}
{"unit_id":"ZhiHui6__dsh-sound-notify#caveat-1","repo":"ZhiHui6/dsh-sound-notify","commit":"de3b314b468c852652cf2a58c6902fa7ddc50316","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-sound-notify 使用浏览器 localStorage 保存设置，并将自定义音频作为 data URL 持久化；单个文件限制为 1.5 MB，存储空间不足时保存可能失败。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:10-11","client.js:182-196","client.js:589-612"]}
